    <HediffDef ParentName="AddictionBase">
        <defName>BD_AmphetaminesRecovery</defName>
        <label>amphetamines Recovery</label>
        <description>The neural system is finally stabilizing after enduring the devastating stimulant crash. While the acute side effects have subsided, the overstimulated brain and body are undergoing a readjustment period to restore their natural chemical balance. Once this phase concludes, the accumulated stimulant factor will be fully reset.</description>
