        <description>The body's adaptation to continuous exposure to Modafinil. Higher tolerance reduces the efficiency and duration of its sleep and hunger suppression. While it never leads to chemical addiction, it drives the pawn to consume the drug more frequently to maintain alertness, vastly increasing the risk of driving the Modafinil Factor to dangerous levels.</description>
